            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Ting 0.7.14

- launcha now finds Finder and installed copies of Safari, including Safari installations that macOS exposes through a hidden application link.
- You can search for an app by its `.app` filename as well as its display name. For example, searching for `Finder` also works when macOS shows a localized name.
]]></description>
